<title>NETHERLANDS: Shares in Royal Dutch slip on Q3 results.</title>
<headline>Shares in Royal Dutch slip on Q3 results.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1996-10-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in Royal Dutch slipped 4.90 guilders to 281.10 and recovered somewhat to 284.00 guilders within ten minutes after the firm released its third quarter results.</p>
<p>The firm posted third quarter current cost net profit of 1,117 million pound sterling.</p>
<p>Analyst forecasts for current cost net profit varied between 1,152 and 1,280 million stg. compared with 1,163 million during the same period a year ago.</p>
</text>
